1
00:00:00,609 --> 00:00:03,039
(Leonard:)I don't care.

2
00:00:05,013 --> 00:00:06,583
Wrong! Hunt's!

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:09,550
Hey, Amy!
What do you say?

4
00:00:09,551 --> 00:00:11,851
(Sheldon:)You ready to move on
to the mustard round?

5
00:00:11,854 --> 00:00:14,724
(Amy:)Have you not noticed that
I've been sitting back here

6
00:00:14,723 --> 00:00:17,023
(Amy:)quietly stewing for
the past two hours?

7
00:00:17,993 --> 00:00:20,393
(Sheldon:)I just thought
you were bad at the game.

8
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,400
I'm mad at you!

9
00:00:24,466 --> 00:00:26,036
(Amy:)How could you just
go away like that

10
00:00:26,034 --> 00:00:27,304
(Amy:)without even
saying good-bye,

11
00:00:27,302 --> 00:00:29,502
(Amy:)and then call Leonard
for help instead of me?

12
00:00:32,374 --> 00:00:33,474
Amy?

13
00:00:33,475 --> 00:00:35,645
(Sheldon:)May I please have
a moment of privacy

14
00:00:35,644 --> 00:00:37,774
(Sheldon:)to speak with my roommate?

15
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:40,910
We're in a moving car!

16
00:00:43,051 --> 00:00:44,481
(Amy:)What do you expect me to do?

17
00:00:44,486 --> 00:00:46,556
(Amy:)Stick my fingers in my ears?

18
00:00:46,555 --> 00:00:48,185
(Sheldon:)Well, I was thinking
put your head out the window

19
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:49,590
(Sheldon:)like a dog, but that'll work.

20
00:00:50,826 --> 00:00:52,496
(Sheldon:)Please? This'll be quick.

21
00:00:57,433 --> 00:00:59,063
(Sheldon:)Leonard?

